Moonlight.pak UI is moonlight-pak from:

  https://github.com/richieszemeredi/nextui-moonlight-pak
  Richie Szemeredi, Moonlight.pakz v0.1.0 (my355, Apostrophe).

Rebuilt here against Apostrophe
  https://github.com/Helaas/Apostrophe
  Copyright (c) 2026 Kevin Vranken, MIT (LICENSE.apostrophe)
with Zlyme Flip joystick mapping (NextUI JOY_*). Upstream Apostrophe
treats the Flip as keyboard scancodes; this image's joypad does not.

The streamer on PATH is moonlight-embedded from this image (/usr/bin/moonlight),
not the pak. See LICENSE in this directory (upstream pak license).
